GAL16V8
LATCH16

S    R    D    G    A    B    EN   NC   NC   GND
NC   NC   NC   NC   NC   Y    DL   Q    SEL  VCC

Q.T = S + Q * /R
Q.E = VCC

DL.T = D * G + DL * /G + D * DL
DL.E = VCC

SEL.T = A * /B
SEL.E = EN

Y.T = A * /B + /A * B
Y.E = VCC

DESCRIPTION

galre selftest example (complex mode): set/reset latch Q, transparent D latch DL (hazard-free cover),
decode SEL with an output enable, XOR Y. Pins 8, 9, 11-15 unconnected.
